WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.160 --> 00:00:03.600
Another thing Dr. Bright is not&nbsp;
allowed to do at the Foundation:&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:03.600 --> 00:00:07.680
No using SCP-914 to make magic horses!

00:00:07.680 --> 00:00:12.560
Yes, Dr. Bright, it was very cute when you put a&nbsp;
miniature horse in the Clockworks on "Very Fine,"&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:12.560 --> 00:00:18.000
its little unicorn horn and wings were lovely.&nbsp;
But it's unethical to test these living creatures,&nbsp;&nbsp;

00:00:18.000 --> 00:00:22.480
we don't know what kind of powers it will&nbsp;
give them, and no shelter wants them.

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:24.480
No, you can't keep them, either.

